  displayImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d2f39a03dbe09e546966ff2675823aa9, type: 3}
  displayText: The 6th graders at a middle school voted for their student council
    positions.<br> There were 300 votes in total.<br>How many votes did the winner
    get?
  solutionImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d2f39a03dbe09e546966ff2675823aa9, type: 3}
  solutionText: 117 = 39 * 3 = 120 - 3
